  "slug": "easy-broccoli-slaw",
  "name": "Quick and Easy Broccoli Slaw",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This creamy broccoli slaw is the perfect crunchy side dish that's easy to make with prepared broccoli slaw, cranberries, and walnuts. Try adding diced apples or crumbled bacon.",
